  "scope": "Complete structural payload mass bounds propagate through actual repaired constructors, captured environments, warm winners, and pending outcomes. Original successful source payloads produce the initial store bound. Encoded widths and constructor charges derive a numeric returned-store ceiling. One initial budget constructs serial optional binders that consume their actual preceding results. Exact checked physical traces retain populated native/domain/operation tables. Other recursive-query instructions, whole generated-query budgets, general constrained completion, convergence, concrete host capacity, frontend/runtime adapters, and complete public Haskell correspondence remain open."
